# NAME TAG: the releases (github.com/adyoull/NAME) riscos-fheroes2 is built
# with (riscos-crossdev's docs/CI.md). The riscos-crossdev line chooses the
# container image the GitHub workflows build in, and so the toolchain. The
# riscos-mesa line is the devkit (SDL2, zlib) and the riscos-softmidi line
# the MIDI synthesiser's source and SoundFont that build/fetch.sh downloads;
# their sha256s are in build/SHA256SUMS.txt (ci/riscos-deps-hook.sh moves
# those lines with these).
riscos-crossdev v1.8.2
riscos-mesa v20.3.5-17
riscos-softmidi v0.5.0
